{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/710","id":4748481438,"node_id":"PR_kwDORnQJEs8AAAABGwgTng","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/710","diff_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/710.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/710.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/issues/710","number":710,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat(messaging): edit, delete, pins, mute, inbox pin and unified inbox services (MSG split 3/4 of #660)","user":{"login":"BradleyGleavePortfolio","id":264851314,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8lPcg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264851314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Split piece 3/4 of #660 (A3-MSG-CORE messaging inbox), B-SPLIT-MSG-120 (agent 120). Draft.\n\n## Tier header\n- **Tier:** T4\n- **Why:** Message edit and delete-for-everyone (content erasure, voice object erasure ledger), thread pins, per-user mute and inbox pin, unified inbox query bound to coach scope (PII, tenancy).\n- **T4 trigger scan:** PII/erasure: YES (tombstone erases body/voice, durable voice erasure). Tenancy: YES (inbox bound to head-coach namespace and authorized clients). Money/auth: no.\n- **T3 trigger scan:** New services registered in MessagingModule (no route uses them yet). Concurrency: pin cap under a thread advisory lock, conditional writes.\n- **Bounded T1:** none.\n- **Canonical builder:** B-SPLIT-MSG-120 (agent 120), split of TGP annex lane A3-MSG-CORE (#660).\n- **Parent owner:** operator agent 120.\n- **Acceptance evidence:** messaging-core-v2.spec.ts 36/36 (adds edit, delete, pins, mute, inbox pin, unified inbox); no-pii-in-logs 11/11 (local, targeted); tsc clean; full suite in this PR's CI.\n- **Promotion triggers:** flipping `FEATURE_MESSAGING_CORE_V2=true` needs the whole stack landed, mobile thread polish and the\n  operator call on \"delete erases content\" (#660 body); D1 resolved.\n\n## Contents (1,092 lines)\n| File | Lines |\n|---|---|\n| src/messaging/message-actions.service.ts | 419 |\n| src/messaging/messaging-inbox.service.ts | 293 |\n| src/messaging/messaging.module.ts (providers) | 6 |\n| test/messaging/messaging-core-v2.spec.ts (+ edit, delete, pins, mute, inbox pin, unified inbox) | 374 |\n\nProviders are registered but no route reaches them until split 4/4.\n\n## Split provenance\n- Original: #660 (`feat/a3-msg-core-inbox`) @ `6055648506036c4b649cc7958c50ff86c132e997` (3,041 lines; never reviewed; no AUDIT or FIX ROUND comments).\n  Prior verdicts: none. Its CI on 10-03 was green except community-live-tests (run 37082428163, see \"Known red\" below).\n- Reference merge M = `cd130ae4cd4e0f72657110e980fc1ccd73ab5910` (branch `agent120/msg-split-0-merged-reference`): #660 merged with main `ee55f814eb02b530e6578a168dc16c7ea7e2b07b`,\n  conflicts resolved once. `git show --remerge-diff cd130ae4` shows every resolved hunk.\n- Stack: split 1/4 (main) <- split 2/4 <- split 3/4 <- split 4/4. Land as one stack (MERGE_DEPENDENCY_GUIDE rule 11).\n- Top-tree equality: `git rev-parse cd130ae4^{tree}` == `git rev-parse <split 4/4 head>^{tree}` == `2ba9ed0815f36b6b0b7d20b7cd4ba252fb2ff749`;\n  `git diff cd130ae4 <split 4/4 head>` is empty. No A/B fixes are included (the job is split only).\n\n## Main-merge resolutions (all in M; each lives in the piece that owns the file)\n1. `src/messaging/messaging.service.ts` imports (textual): both sides kept. [split 2]\n2. `sendAsCoach` insert (textual, two hunks): welcome-job sends (B-609-3, internal only, never carry `client_message_id` or\n   `reply_to_id`) keep main's lease-fenced `persistCoachMessage`; every other send takes #660's `insertThreadMessage`; one\n   `duplicate` flag skips every side effect for a welcome duplicate and for an idempotent replay. Both helpers are byte-identical\n   to their side. [split 2]\n3. `src/account-deletion/account-deletion.manifest.ts` (semantic; main's erasure-manifest-coverage gate, A-608-1):\n   CoachMessage.deleted_by_id / pinned_by_id detach; CoachThreadState user_id / coach_id / client_id delete. [split 1]\n4. Log calls (semantic; main's no-pii-in-logs C-700-2 baseline): the mute-lookup warn and both thread-updated warns print\n   `describeFailure(err)` instead of exception text. [split 2]\n5. `test/messaging/messaging-core-v2.spec.ts` (semantic): row fixture gains `welcome_job_id: null` (B-609-3 column), the tx double\n   gains `communityVoiceErasure.updateMany` (main C-610-12). [split 2]\n\n## Known red (inherited from #660, pre-existing gap on main; operator decision D1)\ncommunity-live-tests: `test/messaging/rls/coach-thread-state-rls.live.spec.ts` case \"pin / reply columns are visible to participants\nand to no one else\" fails because no migration in the chain enables RLS on \"CoachMessage\" (only the loose\n`prisma/migrations/rls_fitness_backend.sql` does; policy `coach_message_participant_access` from 20260607000000 is inert while RLS\nis off). The split carries the spec unchanged. Details and options: ops report B-SPLIT-MSG-120 (D1).\n\n## Flags\n`FEATURE_MESSAGING_CORE_V2` stays unset (off). Flag flips are a separate operator PR after the stack lands.\n","created_at":"2026-10-05T17:17:46Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T21:28:39Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"4dc05a555ad0359c5e35964f3c0d0cdf872863aa","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11278565662,"node_id":"LA_kwDORnQJEs8AAAACoEFBHg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/labels/size/size/XL","name":"size/size/XL","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/710/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/710/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/issues/710/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/statuses/654b048a911d952ec2467e2adda893923783ef6f","head":{"label":"BradleyGleavePortfolio:agent120/msg-split-3-actions-inbox","ref":"agent120/msg-split-3-actions-inbox","sha":"654b048a911d952ec2467e2adda893923783ef6f","user":{"login":"BradleyGleavePortfolio","id":264851314,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8lPcg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264851314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/followi